#: rc.cpp:1212
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check if the DTEP can act as a top level DTEP. This means that the document "
"can be of this type. Some pseudo DTEPs cannot act as a top level DTEP, like "
"<i>PHP</i> as they are always included as part of another DTEP, while some "
"others can be included and act as standalone as well, like the case of "
"<i>CSS</i>."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn sik de DTEP as DTEP op böverst Evene bruken lett. Dit "
"bedüüdt, dat dat Dokment vun dissen Typ wesen kann. En poor Pseudo-DTEPs "
"laat sik nich op böverst Evene bruken, liek t.B. <i>PHP</i>, wiel se jümmers "
"binnen en anner DTEP wesen mööt, man en poor anner laat sik ok alleen "
"bruken, liek t.B. <i>CSS</i>."

